      "text": "The AI Engineer Roadmap",
      "hash": "0ecca41f97662f50fc4210f00b4d05ed73257d862ecbd642b906cd7da42d4092"
    },
    {
      "id": "e14267183b8c8f244038c2a0da728c4787eb26475e1c92a698ef41f3a17bb5bc",
      "text": "Want to build AI-powered apps, but don't know where to start? You need a roadmap.",
