      "id": "d14ddd4969c35563bda1b742a0863f7a893b812f60d251e211abafb2bfc9cecc",
      "text": ", in order",
      "hash": "68cba9003488304327954a8e8befa73118d6753600a5c8ba21d2b99194e0ee1e"
    },
    {
      "id": "ce9f2b51adb676e9f94338690c4eb9cce0854d5824e7843e201ce73e9b9570d6",
      "text": "Explore the role of an AI Engineer, learn the key skills needed, and discover how it differs from ML Engineering and AI-assisted Development.",
      "hash": "f369d2a8d00b8817f21389fa642c2f31fa6db4cc06186279387064bd95d62072"
    },
    {
      "id": "1766f8e6e4fa4263e018f350942a9e44b2544d535f026759d712eea315b46e32",
      "text": "Discover when to use LLMs for data tasks like structuring and classification, and when to opt for deterministic systems.",
      "hash": "cc535db479f82807922e33f68f7f1fe03f1062466deab59986be029bbedc8adf"
    },
    {
      "id": "dd9500b5c5e657350d6b74980a2461eada7aaebe96ac21d801e8ff4bb11ab672",
      "text": "Lesson",
      "hash": "6e2b26d9de4033b952bd242f69b798420ee887151b937f394efc23252c78af74"
    },
    {
      "id": "9a0161d46f1ab09ccb48e9c4079d1bac71dc9ffd2623bd25be14cfbd4e095194",
      "text": "Discover the basics of Large Language Models (LLM), their structure, operation, and creation process. Perfect for beginners ready to dive into AI.",
      "hash": "5b0896cb80221a50e2defa68fbcabda11e84f6af3ff49e4d7de3071fe7ab6929"
    },
    {
      "id": "078b5d5897417290ddc790d33c18992ade4fc17af8631cc86d1467812327591a",
      "text": "Discover the best way to choose the right LLM for your AI app. Learn about open vs closed models, cost, latency, and hosting options.",
      "hash": "8310c5c45f15d1e6a78d96a1a6ae70d53216ddab07ce494db0bb800566992b7a"
    },
    {
      "id": "f9b78c2d82ffa142a9b103a708f72d84fea9704dbfdf3b24920cbed5d5e1a45c",
      "text": "Learn how to build successful LLM applications by defining clear success metrics, and creating a data-driven culture of continuous improvement.",
      "hash": "02ecdd3a3757c036153f2cee64b1e2607642a9a7191df28163c403e926d02735"
    },
    {
      "id": "794316d5ac00efa255037a60af0a2e18a1858f00be5f455faa3b08e4e28dd42c",
      "text": "How do you know if your AI application is hallucinating? How do you ensure it's outputting what you want it to? Evals are the answer.",
      "hash": "1f678e4c3ce147fc0ff2d8ffa1f7321ed744547d3d26009f89bd5ee66e54853d"
    },
    {
      "id": "60460730804d6e2a3b69c0893b1fde9bf2ff3cf059cd47c718bc717805bf939e",
      "text": "A directory of techniques for improving your LLM-powered app.",
      "hash": "241b79fbd537ae1e4549e9dd02ab986063c0077b32967bbeb5875f59bbb5d800"
    },
    {
      "id": "04c025014e96cf6df6021f90df44782a00a9ed2ecd3fef3ae38e12d604ff8179",
      "text": "After this series",
      "hash": "75f6cb80aa7bdad3183593378875eef704e6283a499b6ff6abbd23b39e102b7e"
    },
    {
      "id": "1178a06db95574dd381d42e9ed6a79a853a51480a32a463f6294b303cdd6a856",
      "text": "Put it to work with the skills",
      "hash": "afafc559c8d1f99ee7bd9bd45410e1e6f25996b6cdf3f2aa2b79e4a49ed21789"
    },
    {
      "id": "66649df0c6616441935f8a03e5d0f586d661845c17eff5f24488122107ca9414",
      "text": "Free, open-source skills that turn these fundamentals into a real engineering workflow with your agent.",
      "hash": "6fd3244b26a73522c328b991ada3b3cbbcdf48ce9e567250ed819b685d43664e"
    },
